# Schema: Polkadot SDK PRDoc Schema (prdoc) v1.0.0
# See doc at https://raw.githubusercontent.com/paritytech/polkadot-sdk/master/prdoc/schema_user.json

title: Refactor preimage pallet to remove deprecated Currency trait

doc:
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |
      The preimage pallet no longer requires `type Currency: ReservableCurrency` in its
      `Config` trait. The pallet was already using `Consideration` (fungible holds) for
      active deposit operations; `type Currency` was only retained for lazy migration of
      legacy `StatusFor` storage entries.

      This PR replaces the inline lazy migration (`do_ensure_updated` / `ensure_updated`
      extrinsic) with a proper multi-block `SteppedMigration`
      (`pallet_preimage::migration::v2::LazyMigrationV1ToV2<Runtime, OldCurrency>`),
      then removes all Currency-related code.

      **Breaking change:** Remove `type Currency` from `pallet_preimage::Config`.
      Runtimes must remove the line from their configuration:
      ```rust
      // Before
      type Currency = Balances;
      // After: line removed entirely
      ```

      The `ensure_updated` extrinsic (call index 4) and associated error variants
      `TooMany` / `TooFew` have also been removed.

      Runtimes with `pallet_migrations` should register the stepped migration in their
      `Migrations` tuple to convert any remaining legacy `StatusFor` entries:
      ```rust
      type Migrations = (
          // ...existing migrations...
          pallet_preimage::migration::v2::LazyMigrationV1ToV2<Runtime, Balances>,
      );
      ```

      Storage version bumped from 1 to 2.

migrations:
  runtime:
    - reference: pallet_preimage::migration::v2::LazyMigrationV1ToV2
      description: |
        Multi-block stepped migration that converts preimage deposits from the deprecated
        Currency::reserve to Consideration-based holds. For each entry in the legacy
        `StatusFor` storage map, it unreserves the old deposit and creates a new
        Consideration ticket (which uses fungible holds internally), then writes the
        entry to `RequestStatusFor` and removes the old `StatusFor` entry.
  db: []

crates:
  - name: pallet-preimage
    bump: major
    note: "Config trait removes `type Currency`. Extrinsic `ensure_updated` removed."
  - name: westend-runtime
    bump: patch
  - name: rococo-runtime
    bump: patch
  - name: asset-hub-westend-runtime
    bump: patch
  - name: collectives-westend-runtime
    bump: patch
  - name: kitchensink-runtime
    bump: patch
  - name: pallet-referenda
    bump: patch
    note: Test mock updated to remove `type Currency` from preimage config.
  - name: pallet-scheduler
    bump: patch
    note: Test mock updated to remove `type Currency` from preimage config.
  - name: pallet-whitelist
    bump: patch
    note: Test mock updated to remove `type Currency` from preimage config.
  - name: pallet-democracy
    bump: patch
    note: Test mock updated to remove `type Currency` from preimage config.
  - name: pallet-multi-asset-bounties
    bump: patch
    note: Test mock updated to remove `type Currency` from preimage config.
